# Both Python images build from the repo root (the uv workspace lock lives there), so this is an
# allowlist: everything is excluded, then only what the images need is let back in. That keeps
# .git, wp-content, db, reference, docs, scripts (except dev-keys.sh) and every .env out of the
# context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!libs/
!services/
!frontend/
!scripts/dev-keys.sh

# Local build output, environments and caches inside the allowed directories.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/staticfiles
**/.DS_Store
frontend/dist
